@startuml
!include style.iuml
skinparam ArrowFontSize 13
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
' Auto-save and crash recovery (Module 6): ViewModels/ExamSessionViewModel (OnAnswerEdited; SyncTickAsync every 1 s:
' AutosaveScheduler.TakeDue -> SendAsync, then FlushOfflineAsync when the 5 s OfflineRetryDelay has passed, then
' WriteBackupIfDirty; SaveAnswerAsync on question change / focus lost; RestoreAnswersAsync),
' Core/Submission/AutosaveScheduler (10 s), OfflineSaveQueue (passive: FlushAsync(SendPendingAsync), oldest first),
' AnswerMerge (always runs; with a tampered backup only the server copy is merged),
' Core/Backup/AnswerBackupStore (AES-256-GCM, BackupLoadStatus.Tampered);
' DashboardViewModel.StartExamAsync -> ExamsController.StartStudentExam (POST /api/exams/student/start returns the
' InProgress session, D-43), GetSessionAnswers, SaveAnswer (409 STALE_REVISION).
hide footbox
skinparam ParticipantPadding 0
skinparam sequence {
  MessageAlign left
}
skinparam maxMessageSize 300

actor Student
participant "ExamSession\nViewModel" as VM
participant "Answer\nBackupStore" as BS
participant "Offline\nSaveQueue" as Q
participant "Exams\nController" as EC

Student -> VM : edit answer
VM -> VM : Revision+1; Autosave-\nScheduler.MarkDirty
loop 1 s sync tick
  opt 10 s after edit (TakeDue); the same call is\nsent at once on question change / focus lost
    VM -> EC : POST sessions/{sid}/save-answer {revision}
    alt reachable
      EC --> VM : 200, or 409 STALE_REVISION
    else offline
      VM -> Q : Enqueue(save)
    end
  end
  opt queue not empty
    VM -> Q : FlushAsync(send)
    VM -> EC : POST sessions/{sid}/save-answer\n(oldest first; retry 5 s if still offline)
  end
  VM -> BS : Save snapshot if dirty\n(AES-256-GCM)
end
== app crash or power cut; relaunch ==
note over VM, EC
DashboardViewModel: POST /api/exams/student/start
-> same InProgress SessionId;
ExamWindow + ExamSessionViewModel created
end note
VM -> EC : GET sessions/{sid}/answers
EC --> VM : answers + revisions
VM -> BS : Load(sessionId)
alt GCM tag fails (Tampered)
  VM -> VM : ignore backup; report\nBackupTampered;\nserver copy wins
else valid
  VM -> VM : AnswerMerge: higher\nrevision wins
end
opt answers server lacks
  VM -> Q : Enqueue; FlushAsync(send)
  VM -> EC : save-answer (replay)
end
VM --> Student : exam\ncontinues
@enduml
